    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2014, CDC played a crucial role in the fund formation and committed $15 million to SPEF, as a cornerstone investor alongside the EIB and the IFC. Our investment supports the growth of small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in Nigeria and Ghana. It also helps the fund manager raise capital from other investors.</narrative>
